OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry at first
OL,6,Ftonight before a few light showers
OL,7,Fmove westwards into the early hours.
OL,8,FFeeling chilly, especially in the
OL,9,Fnorthwest where clearer spells are
OL,10,Fmost frequent. Some mist and fog
OL,11,Fpatches developing in prone locations
OL,12,Fwith light winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FCloudy at first with
OL,15,Fperhaps a few light showers. Turning
OL,16,Fdrier into the afternoon, with sunny
OL,17,Fspells developing. Around average
OL,18,Ftemperatures in an easterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
